{"unit_id":"xiangshu2026__dsh-alpha-guard#card-zh","repo":"xiangshu2026/dsh-alpha-guard","commit":"f2e982bea95f86947454748a838006b3421df915","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-alpha-guard 是面向 DSH 桌面端的策略检查插件：它把 PolicyEngine 接入全局 tools.guard，在工具调用执行前检查相关参数。主要功能包括按白名单和拒绝路径检查读取与写入、识别需要拦截或告警的命令、限制子代理可用工具与路径，以及记录拒绝和告警事件；另含静态文件审计、隔离区和账本命令行工具。适合希望在本机为 DSH 工具调用配置规则并查看审计记录的用户。需要 Node.js 20 或更高版本；可用 DSH_GUARD_EXTRA_ROOTS 增加读取目录，无需 API 密钥或外部账号。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:19-40","lib/policy.js:737-776","lib/malware-audit.js:263-300"]}
{"unit_id":"xiangshu2026__dsh-alpha-guard#card-en","repo":"xiangshu2026/dsh-alpha-guard","commit":"f2e982bea95f86947454748a838006b3421df915","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-alpha-guard checks DSH desktop tool calls through tools.guard. It applies file-path and command rules, limits subagent access, and records denied or warned calls locally. It also offers static file auditing and quarantine management. Requires Node.js 20 or later; no API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:19-40","lib/policy.js:737-776","lib/malware-audit.js:263-300"]}
